<title>USA: PaineWebber increases share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber increases share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Group Inc said on Thursday its the board authorized an increase of 10 million shares to its share repurchase program, bringing the number of shares that can be repurchased to about 15 million.</p>
<p>The company also said it set its regular quarterly dividend of $0.12 per common share, payable on January 3, 1997, to shareholders of record on December 4, 1996.  </p>
<p>As of September 30, PaineWebber said it had about 92.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
